<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Heroic Eidolon Cyber-Wings -->
  <OES_Wings.label>英雄幻影赛博翼</OES_Wings.label>
  <!-- EN: Heroic Cyber-Wings grant unmatched agility with their sleek, cutting-edge design. Designed for use by Eidolons, once called Heroes! Reveals the full potential of its owner.\n\nThese wings enable the user to perform 5 powerful jumps across vast distances.\n\nCan be reloaded using Syntherius. -->
  <OES_Wings.description>英雄赛博翼以其流畅、尖端的设计赋予无与伦比的敏捷性。专为幻影（曾被称为英雄）设计！能够激发其拥有者的全部潜能。\n\n这些翅膀使使用者能够进行5次跨越遥远距离的强力跳跃。\n\n可以使用Syntherius进行重载。</OES_Wings.description>
  <!-- EN: jump -->
  <OES_Wings.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>跳跃</OES_Wings.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <OES_Wings.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>冷却中</OES_Wings.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: heroic jump -->
  <OES_Wings.verbs.heroic_jump.label>英雄跳跃</OES_Wings.verbs.heroic_jump.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Mercenaries Cyber-Wings -->
  <OMG_Wings.label>佣兵赛博翼</OMG_Wings.label>
  <!-- EN: Highly modified Cyber-Wings grant unmatched agility with their sleek, cutting-edge design. Designed for use by Mercenaries.\n\nThese wings enable the user to perform 10 quick jumps across great distances.\n\nCan be reloaded using Syntherius. -->
  <OMG_Wings.description>经过高度改装的赛博翼以其流畅、尖端的设计赋予无与伦比的敏捷性。专为佣兵设计。\n\n这些翅膀使使用者能够进行10次跨越长距离的快速跳跃。\n\n可以使用Syntherius进行重载。</OMG_Wings.description>
  <!-- EN: jump -->
  <OMG_Wings.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>跳跃</OMG_Wings.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <OMG_Wings.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>冷却中</OMG_Wings.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: mercenary jump -->
  <OMG_Wings.verbs.mercenary_jump.label>佣兵跳跃</OMG_Wings.verbs.mercenary_jump.label>
  
</LanguageData>